{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在尖沙咀河內道發現一名昏迷男子，當場證實不治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場是河內道一幢商廈外。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yDEmhLlQX31790203012.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在凌晨約1時半接獲報案，指發現有人在街上昏倒。警方到場發現該名男子被放在椅上。現場消息指該男子已出現屍斑，相信已死去一段時間，是由其他地方移到街上。他大腿上有針孔，懷疑曾經吸毒。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wRtKH4glaV1790202997.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解，警方當場截獲一名酒吧職員，並搜查懷疑涉事酒吧，發現吸食冰毒的工具，拘捕該名職員。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T23:09:30.327976+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}